# Bot2 casts a Llanowar Elves and an Ornithopter on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 evokes Fury, exiling Lightning Bolt (a red card)
# from their hand instead of paying {3}{R}{R}. Its enters trigger deals 4 damage divided as Bot1 chooses: 1 to the Elves
# and 3 to the Ornithopter, killing both (CR 601.2d). The evoke trigger then sacrifices Fury.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fury
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x17

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fury.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Divide(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves: 1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter: 3)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Fury
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
